# Day-to-day + known bug class: RAG agent with reciprocal user<->agent arrows (question/answer) between
# vertically aligned nodes; labels overlapped and sat on foreign arrows in the original render.
title "RAG agent"
dir DOWN
user(User)
agent[Agent loop] :purple
group tools "Tools" :green {
  search[Web search]
  vdb[(Vector DB)]
}
user -> agent : question
agent -> search : query
agent -> vdb : embed + retrieve
search, vdb --> agent : context
agent -> user : answer
